{% assign is_zh = false %}
{% if page.lang contains 'zh' %}{% assign is_zh = true %}{% endif %}

<section class="research-statement">
  <p class="lead">
    {% if is_zh %}
      我的研究聚焦无线感知与人工智能，主要包括面向无线系统的生成式人工智能、 射频与无线感知、具身导航与空间智能三个方向。研究工作关注无线信号的建模、
      生成、感知和定位，并重视相关方法在真实系统中的验证。
    {% else %}
      Wireless systems are more than pipes for moving bits: they are an interface between artificial intelligence and the physical world. My research
      asks how intelligent models can understand the structure and physics of radio signals, then use them to generate, perceive, localize, and act.
    {% endif %}
  </p>
  <div class="section-kicker">
    {% if is_zh %}研究方向{% else %}Research themes{% endif %}
  </div>
  <nav class="research-index" aria-label="{% if is_zh %}研究方向目录{% else %}Research theme index{% endif %}">
    {% for area in site.data.research %}
      <a href="#{{ area.id }}">
        <span class="research-index-number">{{ area.number }}</span>
        <strong class="research-index-title">
          {%- if is_zh %}{{ area.title_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.title_en }}{% endif -%}
        </strong>
        <span class="research-index-short">
          {%- if is_zh %}{{ area.representative_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.representative_en }}{% endif -%}
        </span>
      </a>
    {% endfor %}
  </nav>
  <div class="statement-principles">
    <div>
      <strong>
        {%- if is_zh %}物理结构{% else %}Physical structure{% endif -%}</strong
      ><span>
        {%- if is_zh %}让模型尊重信号与传播规律{% else %}Models grounded in signals and propagation{% endif -%}
      </span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <strong>
        {%- if is_zh %}跨域泛化{% else %}Generalization{% endif -%}</strong
      ><span>
        {%- if is_zh %}跨环境、跨设备与跨模态工作{% else %}Across environments, devices, and modalities{% endif -%}
      </span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <strong>
        {%- if is_zh %}系统验证{% else %}Systems validation{% endif -%}</strong
      ><span>
        {%- if is_zh %}在真实系统、代码与数据中验证方法{% else %}Validate methods through real systems, code, and data{% endif -%}
      </span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="research-details">
  {% for area in site.data.research %}
    <section class="research-detail" id="{{ area.id }}">
      <div class="research-detail-aside">
        <div class="detail-number">{{ area.number }}</div>
        <div class="detail-short">
          {% if is_zh %}{{ area.short_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.short_en }}{% endif %}
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="research-detail-main">
        {% if area.image %}
          <figure class="research-detail-media">
            <img
              src="{{ area.image | relative_url }}"
              alt="{% if is_zh %}{{ area.image_alt_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.image_alt_en }}{% endif %}"
              width="960"
              height="600"
              loading="lazy"
            >
          </figure>
        {% endif %}
        <h2>
          {% if is_zh %}{{ area.title_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.title_en }}{% endif %}
        </h2>
        <p class="detail-tagline">
          {% if is_zh %}{{ area.tagline_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.tagline_en }}{% endif %}
        </p>
        <p>
          {% if is_zh %}{{ area.description_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.description_en }}{% endif %}
        </p>
        <div class="keyword-list">
          {% for keyword in area.keywords -%}
            <span>{{ keyword }}</span>
          {%- endfor %}
        </div>
        <div class="representative-line">
          <strong>
            {%- if is_zh %}相关工作{% else %}Related work{% endif -%}
          </strong>
          <span>
            {%- if is_zh %}{{ area.representative_zh }}{% else %}{{ area.representative_en }}{% endif -%}
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<section class="future-agenda">
  <div class="section-kicker">
    {% if is_zh %}未来议题{% else %}Forward agenda{% endif %}
  </div>
  <h2>
    {% if is_zh %}无线智能与真实世界 AI 的下一步研究{% else %}Next steps in wireless intelligence for real-world AI{% endif %}
  </h2>
  <p>
    {% if is_zh %}
      下一阶段，我希望进一步探索射频基础模型、多模态空间表征，以及通信、感知与行动之间的协同设计， 形成从无线数据生成到具身空间理解的连续研究链条。
    {% else %}
      My forward agenda connects RF foundation models, multimodal spatial representations, and the co-design of communication, sensing, and
      action—from wireless data generation to embodied understanding of physical environments.
    {% endif %}
  </p>
</section>

<section class="research-resources" id="systems-resources" aria-labelledby="systems-resources-heading">
  <div class="section-kicker">
    {% if is_zh %}系统与资源{% else %}Systems & resources{% endif %}
  </div>
  <h2 id="systems-resources-heading">
    {% if is_zh %}与研究方向相关的系统和资源{% else %}Related systems and research resources{% endif %}
  </h2>
  <p class="research-resources-intro">
    {% if is_zh %}
      以下系统、代码、数据与教程对应上述研究主线，为实验、教学和进一步合作提供入口。
    {% else %}
      These systems, codebases, datasets, and tutorials complement the research agenda above and support experimentation, teaching, and future
      collaboration.
    {% endif %}
  </p>
  {% include resources-page.liquid embedded=true %}
</section>
